    "shortDescription": "A guided tour to explore the worlds of Claude Monet and Vincent van Gogh",
    "dietOptions": [],
    "description": "This small-group tour from Paris will take you on a journey that follows in the footsteps of two great artists – Claude Monet and Vincent van Gogh.\r\n\r\nYou'll start from Paris and make your way towards Giverny. Here, you'll explore Monet's pink stucco house and its vast garden lined with willow, cherry and Japanese apricot trees. You'll catch glimpses of several spots that inspired some of the French Impressionist's famous paintings. \r\n\r\nThe tour will also take you to Auvers-sur-Oise, where Vincent van Gogh spent the last three months of his life. You'll be able to spot places that inspired several of his paintings, such as 'The Church at Auvers' and 'Wheatfield with Crows'. You'll get to learn about the life and inspirations of both artists and also visit their tombs.",
